  "details": "VRCAnimatorPlayAudio can currently do two things:\n\n- Play the audio source\n\n- Stop the audio source\n\nI often stop my audio sources whenever they'd be at zero volume, since there's a hard limit of 3 audio sources playing at once.\n\nHowever, this causes the clip to restart from the beginning. It'd be great if I could *pause* the audio source instead, so that when I play it again, it picks up where it left off.",
